  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Enhancing the effectiveness and value for money of European external action for development results</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">External challenge from civil society is important for holding the EU to account. The purpose of this project is to produce evidence and generate debate to influence and improve EU development policy making and implementation. It will cover a number of areas including how to improve the impact of European Union (EU) development policy and programming at country and regional level, the role of the European Union (EU) in conflict prevention and peace-building and how to increase Europen Union (EU) engagement with the private sector.</narrative>
  </description>
